usage: tego block <run> <exec|net|path|read|write> <value> [--for D | --until T] | --list <run> [--json]
  -for string
    	a time limit after which the block ends by itself (45m, 72h, 3d, 1d12h, 7w)
  -json
    	with --list: print the blocks as JSON
  -list
    	list the run's live blocks instead of adding one
  -until string
    	a time limit at which the block ends by itself ("17:00", "tomorrow 09:00", "Fri 17:00", "2026-11-14 17:00")
usage: tego unblock <run> <exec|net|path|read|write> <value> [--for D | --until T]
  -for string
    	a time limit after which the block refuses again (45m, 72h, 3d, 1d12h, 7w)
  -until string
    	a time limit at which the block refuses again ("17:00", "tomorrow 09:00", "Fri 17:00", "2026-11-14 17:00")
  block      refuse a program, a destination or a path in a running run, now
  unblock    remove a live block from a running run, for good or for a while
